# Aliens Gaun (disk, MSX-BASIC game; turbo R machine): AUTOEXEC.BAS loads it,
# the logo and the title are typed out (title by ~40 s); Space from 44 s
# starts a game, then move and fire. On the R800 (option machine 3) the timing
# follows openMSX FS-A1GT; on the Z80 it would still be typing the title.
option machine 3
44s SPACE 5
48s SPACE 5 every 25 until 100s
50s LEFT 60
55s RIGHT 100
62s LEFT 60
70s RIGHT 60
80s LEFT 60
